# Styling

- Define colors, fonts, and radii as tokens in `src/styles/globals.css`.
- Compose classes with `cn()` from `src/lib/cn`.
- Use semantic utilities (`bg-background`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border`).
- Do not introduce one-off hex values in components.

```tsx
// BAD
<div className="bg-[#0a0a0a] text-[#ededed]" />

// GOOD
<div className={cn("bg-background text-foreground", className)} />
```
